<#
Add-Instructor-Sidebar.ps1

Adds a proper vertical sidebar shell to the Instructor portal (apps/web),
matching the pattern already used by the Admin portal (AdminShell):
  - apps/web/lib/instructor-nav-config.ts
      Nav sections + items: Overview, Courses, Engagement, Growth,
      Finance, Mentorship, Account - covering all existing instructor pages.
  - apps/web/app/(instructor)/_components/InstructorShell.tsx
      Collapsible desktop sidebar, mobile drawer, sticky top bar with
      notifications + user menu + theme toggle + logout.
  - apps/web/app/(instructor)/layout.tsx
      Wraps every /instructor/* route in InstructorShell.

Each file is embedded below as Base64 and written directly into the
$files hashtable (no intermediate $b64_<name> variables), then decoded
with [System.IO.File]::WriteAllBytes(). This script itself is pure ASCII.

Run from the SAI2 project root:
    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\Add-Instructor-Sidebar.ps1
#>

$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"

$root = $PSScriptRoot
if (-not $root) { $root = (Get-Location).Path }

Write-Host "Project root: $root" -ForegroundColor Cyan

$files = @{}

